Darklon wrote:
> I was wondering does anyone know much about Vulture's eye or whatever
> its called?... the graphical add on for nethack?  any good? worth
> getting? or not?

It's not my thing, because IMHO Nethack has to be played via telnet and 
with the vi keys :-) (if I want tiles, I know where to get POWDER). Also 
the isometric perspective does'nt give you any more information than the 
classic ASCII interface (probably even less, because features can be 
hidden behind other features and because the level is too big to fit on 
the screen in the isometric view). But if you like this kind of thing, 
more power to you.

